JSONs which are exchanged between platform and pc

# ---------------- Platform -> PC ---------------- #

1. Sending odometry data
 - Sends accumulated odometry readings.
{
"data-type" : "odometry"
"payload"   : "[x0, y0, x1, y1, ...]"
}

2. Sending lidar scan
 - Sends single stationary lidar scan
 - position -> Position on which scan has been performed
 - bearing  -> angle between the direction that platform is facing and magnetic north
 - payload  -> raw data from lidar (
                                    r - distance,
                                    phi - angle in driving plane,
                                    theta -angle in vertical plane // Probably we'll never use it
                                    )
{
"data-type" : "lidar"
"position"  : "[x0, y0]"
"bearing"   : "angle"
"payload"   : "[r0, phi0, theta0, r1, phi1, theta1, ...]"
}

